msgid "Multiple network devices"
msgstr "Multiple network devices"

msgid ""
"ReliefNT 为每个受支持的 Ethernet PCI 功能分配独立网络接口。e1000、e1000e 和 r8169 "
"可以同时注册，多张相同型号网卡也分别拥有设备状态和 DMA 环。"
msgstr ""
"ReliefNT allocates an independent network interface for each supported "
"Ethernet PCI function. e1000, e1000e, and r8169 can register simultaneously,"
" and multiple adapters of the same model each have their own device state "
"and DMA rings."

msgid "Device identity"
msgstr "Device identity"

msgid ""
"``lo`` 的 ifindex 为 1。硬件接口从 ifindex 2 开始递增，名称为 "
"``eth<ifindex-2>``。接口在一次启动内保持名称和索引，移除后保留索引空洞。 例如卸载拥有 eth0、eth1 的驱动后，仍存在的 "
"eth2 继续使用原来的编号。 重新加载驱动时，新设备获得新的索引和名称。"
msgstr ""
"``lo`` has ifindex 1. Hardware interfaces receive increasing indexes "
"starting at ifindex 2 and are named ``eth<ifindex-2>``. Interfaces retain "
"their names and indexes during a boot, leaving index gaps after removal. For"
" example, after unloading the driver that owns eth0 and eth1, the surviving "
"eth2 keeps its original number. When the driver is reloaded, new devices "
"receive new indexes and names."

msgid ""
"私有 ``include/reliefnt/net_device.h`` 的 ``driver_register_netdev`` 接收 "
"版本化回调表、每设备上下文和索引输出。管理器复制回调表，将其与原驱动 owner 绑定，回调前固定 "
"owner，释放服务锁后执行回调。初始化成功后发布接口。 驱动关闭回调接入、排空引用并停止自身全部设备后，管理器移除对应接口。 停止失败的设备保留 "
"DMA 和模块代码，后续卸载可以重试。"
msgstr ""
"``driver_register_netdev`` in the private ``include/reliefnt/net_device.h`` "
"accepts a versioned callback table, per-device context, and an index output."
" The manager copies the callback table and binds it to the original driver "
"owner, pins the owner before callbacks, and executes callbacks after "
"releasing the service lock. Interfaces are published after successful "
"initialization. Once a driver closes callback admission, drains references, "
"and stops all its devices, the manager removes the corresponding interfaces."
" Devices that fail to stop retain DMA and module code, allowing a later "
"unload to retry."

msgid ""
"旧 ``e1000_*`` 服务入口和 ReliefOS 旧网络管理请求查询首个存活接口。 旧驱动 API "
"表和公开用户结构继续使用原布局。新设备接口属于 ReliefNT 私有 内核接口，原生模块通过精确构建 ABI 关联。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy ``e1000_*`` service entry points and legacy ReliefOS network-"
"management requests query the first surviving interface. The old driver API "
"table and public user structures retain their original layouts. The new "
"device interface is a ReliefNT private kernel interface, with native modules"
" associated through the exact build ABI."

msgid "Configuration and routing"
msgstr "Configuration and routing"

msgid ""
"每张网卡拥有独立的行政状态、IPv4 地址、掩码、广播地址和默认网关。 IPv4 路由优先使用最长前缀，再比较 metric "
"和接口索引。绑定本机源地址和 ``SO_BINDTODEVICE`` 的 socket 按其约束选路。ARP 缓存按接口和下一跳地址 区分。TCP "
"路由变化时重新检查下一跳 MAC，向本机 NIC 地址发送的 TCP、UDP 保留目标接口身份。"
msgstr ""
"Each adapter has independent administrative state, IPv4 address, netmask, "
"broadcast address, and default gateway. IPv4 routing prefers the longest "
"prefix, then compares metric and interface index. Sockets bound to a local "
"source address or using ``SO_BINDTODEVICE`` select routes according to their"
" constraints. ARP caches are distinguished by interface and next-hop "
"address. TCP rechecks the next-hop MAC when routes change; TCP and UDP sent "
"to local NIC addresses retain the destination interface identity."

msgid ""
"IPv6 地址、路由、邻居、多播成员、待发包、重组和 PMTU 携带 ifindex。 逐链路状态通过动态分配管理，RA、RS、DAD、MLD "
"和发现定时分别推进。 不同链路可以使用相同 link-local 地址，socket 的作用域与设备绑定须一致。 现有 IPv6 "
"地址、路由和邻居等共享表仍有各自的资源容量，耗尽时返回错误。"
msgstr ""
"IPv6 addresses, routes, neighbors, multicast memberships, pending packets, "
"reassembly, and PMTU carry ifindex. Per-link state is managed through "
"dynamic allocation, with RA, RS, DAD, MLD, and discovery timers advanced "
"separately. Different links can use the same link-local address, and socket "
"scope must agree with device binding. Existing shared tables for IPv6 "
"addresses, routes, neighbors, and other state still have their own resource "
"capacities and return errors on exhaustion."

msgid ""
"Linux 网络管理入口覆盖按名称、索引查询，IPv4/IPv6 地址和路由操作，以及 行政状态开关。接口配置修改需要 "
"``CAP_NET_ADMIN``。首次设置 ``SO_BINDTODEVICE`` 允许普通进程，更改已有设备绑定需要 "
"``CAP_NET_RAW``。 AF_PACKET 和 raw socket 的创建权限继续由对应协议入口检查。"
msgstr ""
"Linux network-management entry points cover queries by name/index, IPv4/IPv6"
" address and route operations, and administrative state changes. Changing "
"interface configuration requires ``CAP_NET_ADMIN``. Ordinary processes may "
"set ``SO_BINDTODEVICE`` initially; changing an existing device binding "
"requires ``CAP_NET_RAW``. Permissions to create AF_PACKET and raw sockets "
"remain checked at the respective protocol entry points."

msgid ""
"设备直接接收软件提交的帧，发送队列交由各设备的有界 DMA 环管理。 ``SIOCGIFTXQLEN`` 报告的软件队列长度为 0。硬件 MTU 为 "
"1500。"
msgstr ""
"Devices directly receive frames submitted by software, and each device's "
"bounded DMA rings manage its transmit queue. ``SIOCGIFTXQLEN`` reports a "
"software queue length of 0. Hardware MTU is 1500."

msgid ""
"``/proc/net/dev`` 列举所有已登记接口，包括未分配 IPv4 地址或行政关闭的设备。 ``SIOCGIFCONF`` 按 Linux 的"
" IPv4 地址列表语义输出 loopback 和有地址的接口。 枚举硬件接口可使用 rtnetlink 或 "
"``/proc/net/dev``，并按名称查询 ifindex。"
msgstr ""
"``/proc/net/dev`` lists all registered interfaces, including devices without"
" an IPv4 address or administratively down. ``SIOCGIFCONF`` follows Linux "
"IPv4 address-list semantics and outputs loopback and interfaces with "
"addresses. Hardware interfaces can be enumerated with rtnetlink or "
"``/proc/net/dev``, with ifindex queried by name."

msgid "Validation"
msgstr "Validation"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_net_device.py`` 验证多个 owner、独立回调、计数和索引生命周期。 "
"``tools/test_net_multi_interface.py`` 验证 ioctl、rtnetlink 和逐接口选路。 "
"``tools/test_net_multinic_data.py`` 验证 ARP、UDP 输出和 AF_PACKET 隔离。 既有 TCP、UDP "
"和 IPv6 定向套件覆盖对应传输的设备绑定、作用域与资源清理。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_net_device.py`` validates multiple owners, independent "
"callbacks, counters, and index lifecycles. "
"``tools/test_net_multi_interface.py`` validates ioctl, rtnetlink, and per-"
"interface routing. ``tools/test_net_multinic_data.py`` validates ARP, UDP "
"output, and AF_PACKET isolation. Existing targeted TCP, UDP, and IPv6 suites"
" cover device binding, scope, and resource cleanup for their respective "
"transports."

msgid ""
"``tools/tests/multinic_guest.c`` 是标准 socket 用户程序探针，由 ReliefOS 的 "
"``tools/test_multi_nic_qemu.py`` 放入私有来宾执行。来宾使用两张 e1000 和 一张 e1000e，验证独立 "
"DHCP、IPv4/IPv6、并发 TCP/UDP，以及模块卸载期间 另一 owner 的活动 TCP 连接。完整桌面镜像与实体硬件的运行验证分别记录。"
" VMware 验证未完成。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/tests/multinic_guest.c`` is a standard socket userspace probe placed"
" in a private guest by ReliefOS's ``tools/test_multi_nic_qemu.py``. The "
"guest uses two e1000 adapters and one e1000e to validate independent DHCP, "
"IPv4/IPv6, concurrent TCP/UDP, and an active TCP connection on another owner"
" during module unloading. Runtime validation of the full desktop image and "
"physical hardware is recorded separately. VMware validation is incomplete."

